00:03:54.013 --> 00:03:54.950
- Peking duck fact.

00:03:54.950 --> 00:03:55.783
- [Steven] Peking duck fact.

00:03:55.783 --> 00:03:56.616
- [Andrew] Peking duck fact.

00:03:56.616 --> 00:03:59.340
