00:15:23.990 --> 00:15:25.060
it was amazing, I loved it.

00:15:25.060 --> 00:15:26.080
What was your worth it winner?

00:15:26.080 --> 00:15:29.230
- Alan, he is bringing
Peking duck to the masses.

00:15:29.420 --> 00:15:30.970
Like, everybody can enjoy it.

00:15:30.970 --> 00:15:32.720
